$ positional --help
usage: positional  INPUT [SCALE] [--verbose] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]


Required switches:
  INPUT
    1-th argument
    Input file

Optional switches:
  SCALE
    2-th argument
    default value 1.0
    Scale factor
   --verbose
    default value .false.
    Verbose
   --help, -h
    Print this help message
   --markdown, -md
    Save this help message in a Markdown file
   --version, -v
    Print version
